/**
 * Hub Market — the scrim behind the mobile filter drawer.
 *
 * A <label> for the same checkbox the toolbar renders, so tapping outside the
 * drawer closes it with no click handler.
 *
 * IT MUST BE A SIBLING OF `.sidebar-main`, NOT A CHILD, for two independent
 * reasons:
 *
 *  - The drawer is parked off-canvas with `transform: translateX(-100%)`, and a
 *    transformed element becomes the containing block for `position: fixed`
 *    descendants. Nested inside, the scrim would slide with the drawer instead
 *    of covering the viewport.
 *  - `.page-products .columns` is `position: relative; z-index: 1` in blank — a
 *    stacking context. A scrim appended at body level painted OVER the drawer
 *    and swallowed every tap. Sharing the drawer's context gives
 *    drawer (1000) > scrim (999) > page.
 *
 * Hence the `columns` container: a direct child of `.columns`, beside the
 * sidebar. It renders on every product list; it is invisible and inert until
 * the checkbox is checked.
 *
 * @var \Magento\Framework\View\Element\Template $block
 * @var \Magento\Framework\Escaper $escaper
 */
?>
<label class="hm-filters-scrim" for="hm-plp-filters-toggle" aria-hidden="true"></label>
